OL,3,GNEWSANightclubs are disappearing - and
OL,4,Ait's affecting young people
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder-30s have described missing out on
OL,7,Fbeing able to "let loose and mess
OL,8,Faround" because of a "bleak" lack of
OL,9,Fnightlife where they live.
OL,11,FHenry Gannon said that growing up in
OL,12,FWoking he had seen places for young
OL,13,Fpeople to gather and socialise "die
OL,14,Faway".
OL,16,F"Communal areas just seem to have
OL,17,Fvanished," he added.
OL,19,FWoking once had multiple late-night
OL,20,Fvenues - now it does not have any
OL,21,Ftraditional dedicated nightclubs left
OL,22,Fin the town centre.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
